DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T213000
SUMMARY:Bowling Night - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nThi
 s is an event for casual bowling at Montvale Lanes\, 14 W. Grand Ave. All 
 are welcome for **two games\, food and drinks**\, and any post- or pre-gam
 e hang out. Show up anytime! Questions or comments? You can message Andy M
 ilone on Meetup\, or call/text him at **201-234-9609**.\n\n\\*\\*\\* Befor
 e bowling\, we might stop by the Pizza Parlour\, 6 S. Kinderkamack Road in
  Montvale\, for a few slices. Post a comment on the event page to gauge in
 terest. **After bowling\, we'll definitely be heading to Davey's Irish Pub
  & Restaurant\, 5 Park St. in Montvale\, or The Ridge Diner\, 125 Kinderka
 mack Road in Park Ridge\, at 10 p.m. for some food and/or drinks.** \\*\\*
 \\*\n\nAbout the group: People of all ages\, backgrounds and abilities are
  welcome! We're not professionals and we're not in a league. In fact\, we'
 re a group of people who probably each won't score more than 100 points an
 d will land more than our fair share of gutter balls. There's no pressure 
 at all!!!! We're not here to analyze your form or technique.\n\nMore event
  details: You pay for your own games\, food and drinks. Please bring cash.
  The alley does not accept card. But there is an ATM on site. **The** **co
 st per player is $18 for two games** **and bowling shoes.** If you have yo
 ur own shoes\, the cost is $12. Please try to bring exact change since And
 y will have a limited amount of cash. If you bring a $20 bill and he doesn
 't have change\, any remainder would just go toward the bowling alley tip.
 \n\nFood and drinks (alcoholic and non-alcoholic) are available on site\, 
 plus tables and an alley bar to hang at during the event. There is a dart 
 board and a few arcade games\, as well.\n\n**What do you do when you get t
 here?** First\, find the group inside around the front desk. Look for a gr
 owing group of people! Call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609 if you can
 't find us. Once Andy secures the lanes\, please pay him before getting yo
 ur bowling shoes.\n\n**Please know that it is possible we have to wait 20-
 40 minutes until lane(s) free up.** It's also possible that we may have to
  relocate or cancel that night if there's a long wait list upon arrival. P
 lease keep that in mind if traveling from far away!\n\nFor those who don't
  have cars or are looking to avoid driving\, the Montvale Train Station is
  only like a five-minute walk from the bowling alley and can be reached vi
 a the Pascack Valley Line. Last train leaves at 12:20 a.m. and heads towar
 d Hoboken. (https://gmtma.org/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/rail_system_map.j
 pg)\n\nMany thanks to Taylor\, one of our group participants\, for recomme
 nding Montvale Lanes! You can learn more at: www.montvalelanes.com.\n\nHop
 e you'll join us for our 23rd bowling event\, or consider attending one of
  our volleyball\, ping pong\, skating or other activities -> www.meetup.co
 m/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf interested in staying touch
  with group members or conversing about future events\, feel free to inqui
 re about our WhatsApp group chat.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314117548/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260404T064618Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T064618Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314560425@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260505T032119Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nBec
 ause the early bird gets the tennis court! This time slot is a test-in-pro
 gress and feedback is highly encouraged! We can’t please everyone but ma
 ybe we can meet halfway and pass the torch along?\n\nAs we test this out\,
  maybe this can be a staggered arrival event. So those who prefer later st
 art-times can try and maintain momentum for the group and keep things goin
 g and courts reserved for those who are participating in-person with one a
 nother as through this group. If you are a serious attendee then please ke
 ep monitoring each event’s meetup app messages on your phone for updates
  for any one event you are seriously planning to attend.\n\nFor our early 
 morning group I would like to throw in some quick-rotation points games (5
 -7 points and then everyone on that court do a 1-person rotation clockwise
 ) maybe after some initial warm-up rallies if needed. There should be no f
 ormal teams (so we can fairly keep everything mixed) and everyone will ess
 entially have to play both against and with everyone who shows up on any g
 iven day and time slot.\n\nWe are typically beginners to intermediate. If 
 you are very good please go easier on less polished members while still tr
 ying to provide a bit of challenge for them. The goal should be for everyo
 ne to improve or maintain\, but only within keeping positive group energy.
  Because the ultimate goal of course should be to socialize and have fun. 
 And improving our game along the way is only the bonus!\n\nDISCLAIMER: Cou
 rts are subject to availability and weather. If you make serious plans to 
 attend then please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as needed.
  Furthermore\, by attending you also agree to be fully responsible for you
 r own health and safety (e.g. you take breaks and hydrate at your own pers
 onal discretion\, even if it has to be\, for example\, in the middle of a 
 match). By attending you fully absolve anyone other than yourself for any 
 liability regarding your own personal health at these events regardless of
  time\, place\, and weather.\n\nUPDATE 1: Anyone who signs up is automatic
 ally signing up for being there at 8AM. If you plan on attending later the
 n you need to comment here and tell us what time you'll arrive\, most espe
 cially if you're running late the day of. Thanks for your understanding in
  the matter!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314560425/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260430T145739Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260430T145739Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
