SUMMARY:Noontime Cornhole - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nCom
 e hang with us for two to three hours of casual cornhole at a local park.\
 n\nThe gathering is tentatively scheduled for Lodi Memorial Park\, behind 
 the library\, 1 Memorial Dr.\, because the area has four permanent concret
 e boards.\n\nThere is not a ton of parking\, but there is a huge lot acros
 s the street as part of the shopping plaza.\n\nComment below if you have y
 our own boards and beanbags\, or if you want to bring another yard game. A
  volleyball court and basketball court\, as well as turf field\, are also 
 on site. If anyone knows of any other permanent cornhole setups in North J
 ersey\, feel free to also make that suggestion. We may relocate as a resul
 t.\n\n\\*\\*\\* After playing\, we'll likely be heading somewhere for a dr
 ink and snack. Feel free to suggest a spot for a post-cornhole hangout. \\
 *\\*\\*\n\nThere's no fee to play and nothing else you need to do besides 
 show up. Come anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are n
 ot here to analyze your form. We're here for people who haven't played in 
 months\, maybe years\, and just want to occasionally play and hang out.\n\
 nThe event comes to you courtesy of prior suggestions for future events an
 d our group's WhatsApp chat.\n\nHope you'll join us for our first cornhole
  event. Questions or comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/te
 xt him at 201-234-9609.\nCheck out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis\
 , skating or one of our other activities at: [www.meetup.com/north-jersey-
 bowling-soccer-volleyball](https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soc
 cer-volleyball)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/313591683/
